---
title: "exchangeRate (Compound V2: cToken)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_supply_check: totalSupply = totalSupply()
    q_supply_check --> q_initial: totalSupply == 0
    q_initial --> [*]: return initialExchangeRateMantissa
    q_supply_check --> q_calc: totalSupply > 0
    q_calc --> q_components: cash = getCash(); borrows = totalBorrows; reserves = totalReserves
    q_components --> q_compute: totalCashPlusBorrowsMinusReserves = cash + borrows - reserves
    q_compute --> [*]: exchangeRate = totalCashPlusBorrowsMinusReserves / totalSupply; return exchangeRate

    note right of q_calc
        INV-001: exchangeRate = (getCash + totalBorrows - totalReserves) / totalSupply
        INV-002: exchangeRate monotonically increases as interest accrues (no negative reserves)
        INV-003: When totalSupply == 0, initial rate is used (prevents division by zero)
    end note

    note right of q_compute
        INV-004: exchangeRate scaled by 1e(18 - 8 + underlyingDecimals)
        INV-005: Reserves reduce redeemable value (protocol take)
    end note
